  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas South Sudan HIV&amp;AIDS Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a one year national HIV &amp; AIDS project targeting the church structure and other partners working in the related areas of combating the epidemic (HIV &amp; AIDS ) at both national and diocesan level in pastoral  and non pastoral activities with an aim of empowering the church  structures to partner with other local NGO&apos;S,  national organisation, government institutions, and local leaders to effectively deliver the HIV &amp; AIDS initiative.  The programme will focus on advocacy,networking with partners and HIV &amp; AIDS  mainstreaming, education for life programme both at national and the diocesan level, the programme targets seven dioceses and 35 local partners in different locations.</narrative>
  </description>
